HOW TO DELETE

How to clean everything later (important)

When you’re done with the project, you can fully wipe it like this:

1. Delete project
rm -rf /Users/jey/spliit
2. Stop and remove Docker containers
docker stop spliit-db
docker rm spliit-db
3. Remove Docker images + volumes (optional but frees a LOT)

⚠️ This wipes ALL local Docker projects, not just Spliit:

docker system prune -a --volumes
4. If you want maximum cleanup (rarely needed)

Quit Docker Desktop and delete:

~/Library/Containers/com.docker.docker

This alone can free multiple GBs.

